{
  "statement": "The ResponsibilityAgent underscores the importance of ethical compliance and accountability in the library management system. RES-01 ensures that member data is protected, aligning with regulations. RES-02 promotes fairness by providing accessible interfaces for all users. RES-03 captures user actions for accountability in borrowing. RES-04 reinforces borrowing policies that safeguard responsible use. RES-05 promotes responsibility by notifying members of overdue books. RES-06 allows for user feedback, fostering community engagement. RES-07 ensures transparency through annual usage reports. These requirements collectively enhance the ethical framework of the system.",
